              <div class="d-grid gap-3 d-sm-flex justify-content-sm-center">
                <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4" href="#contato">Pedir orçamento</a>
⟦if .Zap⟧                <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4" href="⟦.Zap⟧" target="_blank" rel="noopener">⟦icone "whatsapp"⟧ WhatsApp</a>
⟦else⟧                <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4" href="#servicos">Conheça</a>
⟦end⟧              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="features-icons bg-light text-center" id="servicos">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="mb-5 fw-bold" editavel="servicos.titulo">⟦h .Setor.ServRotulo⟧</h2>
        <div class="row">
⟦range $i, $s := .Setor.Servicos⟧⟦if lt $i 3⟧          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="features-icons-item mx-auto mb-5 mb-lg-3">
              <div class="features-icons-icon d-flex"><span class="m-auto text-primary">⟦icone (pega (list "lightning" "bookmark-star" "shield-check" "heart") $i)⟧</span></div>
              <h3>⟦h $s.Titulo⟧</h3>
              <p class="lead mb-0">⟦h $s.Texto⟧</p>
            </div>
          </div>
⟦end⟧⟦end⟧        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase">
      <div class="container-fluid p-0">
        <div class="row g-0">
          <div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-2 text-white showcase-img" style="background-image: url('⟦img "notebook.jpg"⟧')"></div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-1 my-auto showcase-text">
            <h2 editavel="sobre.titulo">Quem somos</h2>
            <div class="lead mb-0" editavel="sobre.texto"><p>⟦h (maior .Descricao .Setor.Texto)⟧</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-0">
          <div class="col-lg-6 text-white showcase-img" style="background-image: url('⟦img "mesa.jpg"⟧')"></div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 my-auto showcase-text">
            <h2 editavel="como.titulo">Como trabalhamos</h2>
            <div class="lead mb-0" editavel="como.texto"><p>⟦h .Setor.ServIntro⟧ ⟦with index .Setor.Servicos 3⟧⟦h .Texto⟧⟦end⟧</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-0">
          <div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-2 text-white showcase-img" style="background-image: url('⟦img "objetos.jpg"⟧')"></div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-1 my-auto showcase-text">
            <h2 editavel="onde.titulo">Onde estamos</h2>
            <ul class="lead list-unstyled mb-0">⟦template "contatos" .⟧</ul>
            ⟦if not (or .Endereco .Cidade .Telefone .Email .Horario)⟧<p class="lead mb-0" editavel="onde.texto">Atendemos com hora marcada. Fale com a gente pelo formulário abaixo.</p>⟦end⟧
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials text-center bg-light">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="mb-5" editavel="depo.titulo">O que dizem sobre nós</h2>
        <div class="row">
⟦range $i, $d := .Setor.Depo⟧⟦if lt $i 3⟧          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="testimonial-item mx-auto mb-5 mb-lg-0">
              <img class="img-fluid rounded-circle mb-3" src="⟦img (printf "pessoa%d.jpg" (n $i))⟧" alt="" width="190" height="190" loading="lazy">
              <h5>⟦h (index $d 1)⟧</h5>
              <p class="font-weight-light mb-0">“⟦h (index $d 0)⟧”</p>
            </div>
          </div>
⟦end⟧⟦end⟧        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="call-to-action text-white text-center" id="contato">
      <div class="container position-relative">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
          <div class="col-xl-6">
            <h2 class="mb-4" editavel="contato.titulo">⟦h .Setor.Chamada⟧</h2>
            <div class="text-start">⟦template "form-contato" .⟧</div>
            <ul class="contatos-cta">⟦template "contatos" .⟧</ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </page>

