        <div class="col-lg-6 h-100 text-center text-lg-end my-auto">
          <ul class="list-inline mb-0">
⟦if .Insta⟧            <li class="list-inline-item me-4"><a href="⟦.Insta⟧" aria-label="Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="fs-3">⟦icone "instagram"⟧</span></a></li>
⟦end⟧⟦if .Zap⟧            <li class="list-inline-item me-4"><a href="⟦.Zap⟧" aria-label="WhatsApp" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="fs-3">⟦icone "whatsapp"⟧</span></a></li>
⟦end⟧⟦if .Email⟧            <li class="list-inline-item"><a href="mailto:⟦h .Email⟧" aria-label="E-mail"><span class="fs-3">⟦icone "envelope"⟧</span></a></li>
